{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"19726","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/19726","key":"MC-272790","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"31/May/24 3:33 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<h3><a name=\"Thebug\"></a>The bug</h3>\n<p>1.21 pre-release 1 finally fixed \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-902\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-902\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"The end obsidian platform resets every time entities go through the end portal, which can cause blocks to be deleted\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-902\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n by making the replaced blocks drop as items rather than outright deleted as previously. However, this behaviour does not apply to blocks placed within or around the exit end portal when the dragon is killed or resummoned.</p>\n\n<p>The other kind of end portal is also affected, which is reported under \n    <span class=\"jira-issue-macro resolved\" data-jira-key=\"MC-227097\">\n                <a href=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/browse/MC-227097\" class=\"jira-issue-macro-key issue-link\" title=\"End portals delete blocks that are inside of the portal\">\n            <img class=\"icon\" src=\"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/2/universal_avatar/view/type/issuetype/avatar/10303?size=medium\">\n            MC-227097\n        </a>\n                                                    <span class=\"aui-lozenge aui-lozenge-subtle aui-lozenge-success jira-macro-single-issue-export-pdf\">Resolved</span>\n            </span>\n.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Howtoreproduce\"></a>How to reproduce</h3>\n<ol>\n\t<li>Enter the End</li>\n\t<li>Place your precious shulker boxes inside the end fountain</li>\n\t<li>Kill the dragon</li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"Expectedresults\"></a>Expected results</h3>\n<p>As the end portal activates, the blocks replaced by the end portal would be dropped as items and would be sent through the portal.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Actualresults\"></a>Actual results</h3>\n<p>Your items are now gone forever. Well done!</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"Furthernotes\"></a>Further notes</h3>\n<p>Also happens when the portal deactivates during the summoning ritual.</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"31/May/24 11:17 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/35669","id":"35669","filename":"2024-05-31_11.21.04.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","24x24":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","16x16":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png","32x32":"https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/default/default-avatar.png"},"displayName":"muzikbike","active":true,"timeZone":"Europe/Dublin","accountType":"customer"},"created":"31/May/24 3:32 AM","size":"439 kB","mimeType":"image/png","content":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/content/35669","thumbnail":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/thumbnail/35669"},{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/35670","id":"35670","filename":"2024-05-31_11.21.27.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48"